            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Hokkaido Sachi - Estella Place",
            "review_text": "LeHM D\n1 contribution\n0\nBad service\nMay 2024 • Solo\nThe restaurant takes too long to order takeout, and the staff is not enthusiastic about serving customers when ordering takeout. An order of a small number of dishes requires a 50-minute wait even though there are not yet many customers. The rest of the restaurant serves guests arriving later. Staff are not enthusiastic. This is the worst restaurant in the Hokkaido chain\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 19, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
