            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Hokkaido Sachi - Estella Place",
            "review_text": "Duyên P\n1 contribution\n0\nWonderful\nApr 2023 • Couples\nWatch the tiktok review and come to Sushi Hokkaido Sachi to try the giant squid. It took quite a bit to be able to eat this special one since it's not being served in the menu every day. These squids must be extremely fresh and alive in order to make good sashimi. I have to admit that it's the best squid I have ever eaten. Everyone should try this!\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 14, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
