            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Hokkaido Sachi - Estella Place",
            "review_text": "JasmineHolidays\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam174 contributions\n0\nIncompetent staff - poor manager\nApr 2021\nI come here often because the food is good. However, the staff are totally hopeless - very happy to leave you waiting for so long without taking your order. They get orders wrong, bring you the wrong bill. There are so many staff but they just stand around talking, doing nothing. This place needs a proper manager. I think this is the last place I'm coming here. It's also the same at other branches - so disappointing as the food is good, but I can't come back here now.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 27, 2021",
            "rating": 5.0,
