            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Hokkaido Sachi - Estella Place",
            "review_text": "Kinneri K\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam15 contributions\n0\nMessy & Dirty !!\nAug 2020\nI generally like the food at Sushi Hokkaido but the cleanliness standard right now here at the Estella Place branch is pathetic.\n\nThe sofas were dirty + stained. Fine I understand that there is high traffic here but then the fact there are big food pieces (not crumbs!!) on the sofa in the current pandemic times - it doesn’t show the chain’s commitment towards cleanliness. \n\nI had to dust the sofa but when I saw the floor - just couldn’t stand it anymore - had to walk out ! \n\nIf front of the house is like this - imagine the back of the house !!! Seriously - won’t be dining there again due to cleanliness / hygiene concerns...\nRead more\nWritten August 16, 2020",
